# WS1-03. Source: spec/10-modules.md MOD-21/MOD-23: initialization follows the
# init-dependency order (imports plus modules named by initializers); a cycle
# involving runtime-initialized globals is E11100. Contrast: B no longer imports A,
# so A depends on B only and av = 1 + 1 = 2.
expect: reject E11100
contrast: import { av } from Probe.A; export let bv: i32 = av + 1; ==> export let bv: i32 = 1;
contrast-expect: output
--- contrast-output
2
